orascout E2E fixture, version 2.
Same idea as v1, but with different content so the manifest digest changes and
the watcher's diff logic actually triggers a redeploy. The whole point of the
two-version flow is to verify the cycle:
  push v1 -> orascout --once -> file appears
  push v2 -> orascout --once -> file content changes
  orascout --once again -> no-op (digest matches state file)
